<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Proof of <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem6" title="Theorem 4.6. ‣ 4 Convergence analysis ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.6</span></a></h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we present the convergence proof of <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Elsa<math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}_{\text{-L}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>-L</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\text{-L}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.
Formally, we prove the convergence of the following algorithm:</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> <span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Elsa<math id="alg1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}_{\text{-L}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>-L</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\text{-L}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></figcaption>
<div id="alg1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input</span>: Constant <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>; initial points <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{0}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{0}\in\mathbb{R}^{d}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=0,1,2,\ldots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=0,1,2,\ldots</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Update <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math></span>:  <math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pi_{\mathcal{S}}(x^{t}+\lambda^{-1}u^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pi_{\mathcal{S}}(x^{t}+\lambda^{-1}u^{t})</annotation></semantics></math> 
</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Update <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> by finding a point <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> satisfying <math id="alg1.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla f(x^{t+1})+\mathcal{Q}[u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla f(x^{t+1})+\mathcal{Q}[u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})]</annotation></semantics></math>=0 and <math id="alg1.l4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|x^{t+1}-x^{t+1}_{\star}\|\leq\gamma\min\;\{\|x^{t+1}-z^{t+1}\|,\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo lspace="0.280em">⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|x^{t+1}-x^{t+1}_{\star}\|\leq\gamma\min\;\{\|x^{t+1}-z^{t+1}\|,\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|\}</annotation></semantics></math>


</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Update <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>u</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{t+1}=\mathcal{Q}[u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{t+1}=\mathcal{Q}[u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">First, let us define:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle e^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle e^{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\nabla_{x}\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>x</mi></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\nabla_{x}\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\nabla f(x^{t})+u^{t-1}+\lambda(x^{t}-z^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\nabla f(x^{t})+u^{t-1}+\lambda(x^{t}-z^{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=u^{t-1}+\lambda(x^{t}-z^{t})-\mathcal{Q}[u^{t-1}+\lambda(x^{t}-z^{t})]." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=u^{t-1}+\lambda(x^{t}-z^{t})-\mathcal{Q}[u^{t-1}+\lambda(x^{t}-z^{t})].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Thus, we can express the <math id="A1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>u</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u</annotation></semantics></math> step in terms of <math id="A1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e^{t}</annotation></semantics></math> as follows</p>
<table id="A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle u^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle u^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathcal{Q}[u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathcal{Q}[u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})-e^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=u^{t}+\lambda(x^{t+1}-z^{t+1})-e^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Due to <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\lambda-\mu)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\lambda-\mu)</annotation></semantics></math>-strong convexity and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\beta+\lambda)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\beta+\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math>-smoothness of <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}(\cdot,z^{t},u^{t-1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}(\cdot,z^{t},u^{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math>, we know that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\lambda-\mu)\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\|\leq\|e^{t}\|\leq(\lambda+\beta)\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\lambda-\mu)\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\|\leq\|e^{t}\|\leq(\lambda+\beta)\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Moreover, due to strong convexity we also know that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\langle e^{t},x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\rangle\geq(\lambda-\mu)\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mi>t</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\langle e^{t},x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\rangle\geq(\lambda-\mu)\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t}\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.2</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">If <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda\geq\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda\geq\beta</annotation></semantics></math> and we also assume that the iterates <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x^{t}</annotation></semantics></math> stay bounded. Then there exists a non-negative number <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>D</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{D}</annotation></semantics></math> s.t. <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|\leq\bar{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>D</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|\leq\bar{D}</annotation></semantics></math>. With this definition,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx6" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})\geq f_{\min}-{\gamma}(\lambda+\beta)\bar{D}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>D</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})\geq f_{\min}-{\gamma}(\lambda+\beta)\bar{D}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">Note that</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx7" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E22.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=f(x^{t})+\langle u^{t},x^{t}-z^{t}\rangle+\frac{\lambda}{2}\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=f(x^{t})+\langle u^{t},x^{t}-z^{t}\rangle+\frac{\lambda}{2}\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{f(x^{t})+\langle\nabla f(x^{t}),z^{t}-x^{t}\rangle+\frac{\lambda}{2}\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|^{2}}_{\geq f(z^{t})}+\langle e^{t},x^{t}-z^{t}\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{f(x^{t})+\langle\nabla f(x^{t}),z^{t}-x^{t}\rangle+\frac{\lambda}{2}\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|^{2}}_{\geq f(z^{t})}+\langle e^{t},x^{t}-z^{t}\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq f(z^{t})-\|e^{t}\|\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq f(z^{t})-\|e^{t}\|\|x^{t}-z^{t}\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E25"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\geq f_{\min}-{\gamma}(\lambda+\beta)\bar{D}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>D</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\geq f_{\min}-{\gamma}(\lambda+\beta)\bar{D}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality is due to the assumptions and Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma A.1. ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Now let us prove sufficient decrease on <math id="A1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math> in each iteration.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma A.3</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let the assumptions of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem2" title="Lemma A.2. ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a> be true. Also, assume that the parameters <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\gamma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math> are chosen such that</span></p>
<table id="A1.E26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\beta^{2}}{\lambda}+\frac{\beta(\lambda+\beta)\gamma}{\lambda}+\frac{{\gamma}^{2}(\lambda+\beta)}{2}-\frac{(1-{\gamma})^{2}(\lambda-\mu)}{2}&lt;0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\beta^{2}}{\lambda}+\frac{\beta(\lambda+\beta)\gamma}{\lambda}+\frac{{\gamma}^{2}(\lambda+\beta)}{2}-\frac{(1-{\gamma})^{2}(\lambda-\mu)}{2}&lt;0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Note that <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda-\mu\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda-\mu\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>. Then, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.E27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{r\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{r\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|=0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Let</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})=\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})}_{(A)}\\
+\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})}_{(B)}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></munder></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></munder></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})=\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})}_{(A)}\\
+\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})}_{(B)}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<br class="ltx_break">
<p id="A1.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">We want to show that <math id="A1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(A)+(B)\leq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(A)+(B)\leq 0</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(A)=\langle u^{t+1},x^{t+1}-z^{t+1}\rangle-\langle u^{t},x^{t+1}-z^{t+1}\rangle=\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\left\|u^{t+1}-u^{t}\right\|^{2}+\langle e^{t+1},u^{t+1}-u^{t}\rangle\bigg)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(A)=\langle u^{t+1},x^{t+1}-z^{t+1}\rangle-\langle u^{t},x^{t+1}-z^{t+1}\rangle=\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\left\|u^{t+1}-u^{t}\right\|^{2}+\langle e^{t+1},u^{t+1}-u^{t}\rangle\bigg).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">Using our definitions, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E28"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(A)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(A)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E28.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\|u^{t+1}-u^{t}\|^{2}+\langle e^{t+1},u^{t+1}-u^{t}\rangle\bigg)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\|u^{t+1}-u^{t}\|^{2}+\langle e^{t+1},u^{t+1}-u^{t}\rangle\bigg)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E29"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\|\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\|^{2}+\langle e^{t+1},\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\rangle\bigg)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\|\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\|^{2}+\langle e^{t+1},\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\rangle\bigg)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(29)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E30"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\|\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\|^{2}+\|e^{t+1}\|\|\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\|\bigg)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\|\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\|^{2}+\|e^{t+1}\|\|\nabla f(x^{t+1})-\nabla f(x^{t})\|\bigg)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(30)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\beta^{2}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\beta\|e^{t+1}\|\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|\bigg)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\beta^{2}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\beta\|e^{t+1}\|\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|\bigg)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\beta^{2}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\beta(\lambda+\beta)\|x^{t+1}-x^{t+1}_{\star}\|\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|\bigg)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\beta^{2}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\beta(\lambda+\beta)\|x^{t+1}-x^{t+1}_{\star}\|\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|\bigg)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\beta^{2}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\beta(\lambda+\beta)\gamma\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}\bigg)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\lambda^{-1}\bigg(\beta^{2}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\beta(\lambda+\beta)\gamma\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}\bigg)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\lambda^{-1}\beta\bigg(\beta+(\lambda+\beta)\gamma\bigg)\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\lambda^{-1}\beta\bigg(\beta+(\lambda+\beta)\gamma\bigg)\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(34)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the last inequality is due to Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem1" title="Lemma A.1. ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a> and the way <math id="A1.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x^{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is chosen in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">On the other hand:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex4X"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(B)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4Xa"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})+\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})}_{\leq 0\text{ (due to update of $y$)}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mtext> (due to update of </mtext><mi mathsize="0.700em">y</mi><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})+\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})}_{\leq 0\text{ (due to update of $y$)}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4Xb"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4Xc"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x_{\star}^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})}_{\leq\frac{\beta+\lambda}{2}\|x^{t+1}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|^{2}}+\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x_{\star}^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})}_{\leq-\frac{(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\|x_{\star}^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></munder></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x_{\star}^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})}_{\leq\frac{\beta+\lambda}{2}\|x^{t+1}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|^{2}}+\underbrace{\mathcal{L}(x_{\star}^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t+1},u^{t})}_{\leq-\frac{(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\|x_{\star}^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4Xd"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\beta+\lambda}{2}\|x^{t+1}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|^{2}-\frac{(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\|x_{\star}^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\beta+\lambda}{2}\|x^{t+1}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|^{2}-\frac{(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\|x_{\star}^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p8.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.2.1" class="ltx_text">Now note that <math id="A1.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|\geq(1-{\gamma})\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|x^{t}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|\geq(1-{\gamma})\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|x^{t+1}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|\leq{\gamma}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|x^{t+1}-x_{\star}^{t+1}\|\leq{\gamma}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|</annotation></semantics></math> because of the update rules of Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Plugging in these, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(B)\leq\bigg(\frac{{\gamma}^{2}(\lambda+\beta)}{2}-\frac{(1-{\gamma})^{2}(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\bigg)\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(B)\leq\bigg(\frac{{\gamma}^{2}(\lambda+\beta)}{2}-\frac{(1-{\gamma})^{2}(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\bigg)\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(35)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p8.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.3.1" class="ltx_text">Now combining the inequalities for <math id="A1.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(A)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(A)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(B)</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(36)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\underbrace{\bigg(\frac{\beta^{2}}{\lambda}+\frac{\beta(\lambda+\beta)\gamma}{\lambda}+\frac{{\gamma}^{2}(\lambda+\beta)}{2}-\frac{(1-{\gamma})^{2}(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\bigg)}_{\alpha}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mi>λ</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mi>α</mi></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\underbrace{\bigg(\frac{\beta^{2}}{\lambda}+\frac{\beta(\lambda+\beta)\gamma}{\lambda}+\frac{{\gamma}^{2}(\lambda+\beta)}{2}-\frac{(1-{\gamma})^{2}(\lambda-\mu)}{2}\bigg)}_{\alpha}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(37)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p8.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.4.1" class="ltx_text">Now for any <math id="A1.p8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle f_{\min}-{\gamma}(\lambda+\beta)\bar{D}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>D</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle f_{\min}-{\gamma}(\lambda+\beta)\bar{D}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E38.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{L}(x^{T+1},z^{T+1},u^{T+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathcal{L}(x^{T+1},z^{T+1},u^{T+1})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(38)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathcal{L}(x^{0},z^{0},u^{0})+\sum_{t=0}^{T}\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathcal{L}(x^{0},z^{0},u^{0})+\sum_{t=0}^{T}\mathcal{L}(x^{t+1},z^{t+1},u^{t+1})-\mathcal{L}(x^{t},z^{t},u^{t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(39)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\alpha\sum_{t=0}^{T}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\mathcal{L}(x^{0},z^{0},u^{0})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\alpha\sum_{t=0}^{T}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}+\mathcal{L}(x^{0},z^{0},u^{0}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(40)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p8.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p8.5.1" class="ltx_text">Now if the parameters are chosen appropriately such that <math id="A1.p8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha&lt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, then the right hand side of the above inequality is decreasing as <math id="A1.p8.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> increases, while the left hand side is constant. Therefore, we have <math id="A1.p8.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{T\rightarrow\infty}\sum_{t=0}^{T}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}&lt;\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{T\rightarrow\infty}\sum_{t=0}^{T}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|^{2}&lt;\infty</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus, <math id="A1.p8.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{r\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{r\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{t+1}-x^{t}\|=0</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem A.4</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Assume that all the assumptions of Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a> is satisfied. Then, For any limit point <math id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\bar{x},\bar{z},\bar{\lambda})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>λ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\bar{x},\bar{z},\bar{\lambda})</annotation></semantics></math> of the Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, <math id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{x}</annotation></semantics></math> is a <math id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>-stationary solution of the problem.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.4" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text">Consider a sub-sequence <math id="A1.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x^{r_{t}},z^{r_{t}},u^{r_{t}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x^{r_{t}},z^{r_{t}},u^{r_{t}})</annotation></semantics></math>, for <math id="A1.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=0,\cdots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em">⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=0,\cdots</annotation></semantics></math> which converges to <math id="A1.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\bar{x},\bar{z},\bar{u})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>z</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\bar{x},\bar{z},\bar{u})</annotation></semantics></math>. First of all due to Lemma <a href="#A1.Thmtheorem3" title="Lemma A.3. ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.3</span></a>, we know that <math id="A1.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}+1}-x^{r_{t}}\|=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}+1}-x^{r_{t}}\|=0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p9.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}-1}-x^{r_{t}}\|=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}-1}-x^{r_{t}}\|=0</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus,</span></p>
<table id="A1.E41" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}x^{r_{t}+1}=\bar{x}~~\&amp;~~\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}x^{r_{t}-1}=\bar{x}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.604em">&amp;</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}x^{r_{t}+1}=\bar{x}~~\&amp;~~\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}x^{r_{t}-1}=\bar{x}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(41)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p9.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.2.1" class="ltx_text">Moreover, due to the updates of the algorithm</span></p>
<table id="A1.E42" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}+1}-x_{\star}^{r_{t}+1}\|\leq\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}{\gamma}\|x^{r_{t}+1}-x^{r_{t}}\|=0~~\&amp;~~\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}}-x_{\star}^{r_{t}}\|\leq\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}{\gamma}\|x^{r_{t}}-x^{r_{t}-1}\|=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">≤</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.882em" rspace="0.604em">&amp;</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">≤</mo><mrow><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}+1}-x_{\star}^{r_{t}+1}\|\leq\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}{\gamma}\|x^{r_{t}+1}-x^{r_{t}}\|=0~~\&amp;~~\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}\|x^{r_{t}}-x_{\star}^{r_{t}}\|\leq\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}{\gamma}\|x^{r_{t}}-x^{r_{t}-1}\|=0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(42)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p9.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.3.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, <math id="A1.p9.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}e^{r_{t}}=\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}e^{r_{t}+1}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0.167em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}e^{r_{t}}=\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}e^{r_{t}+1}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, which means</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E43.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{u}=\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}u^{r_{t}}=-\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}(\nabla f(x^{r_{t}})-e^{r_{t}})=-\nabla f(\bar{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><munder><mo lspace="0.1389em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0.167em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{u}=\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}u^{r_{t}}=-\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}(\nabla f(x^{r_{t}})-e^{r_{t}})=-\nabla f(\bar{x})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(43)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E44.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}u^{r_{t}+1}=-\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}(\nabla f(x^{r_{t}+1})-e^{r_{t+1}})=-\nabla f(\bar{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><munder><mo lspace="0em" movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}u^{r_{t}+1}=-\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}(\nabla f(x^{r_{t}+1})-e^{r_{t+1}})=-\nabla f(\bar{x})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(44)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p9.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p9.4.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, <math id="A1.p9.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}u^{r_{t}+1}=\bar{u}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}u^{r_{t}+1}=\bar{u}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text">Also, as <math id="A1.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math> is finite, there exists a large enough T, such that <math id="A1.p10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z^{r_{t}}=\bar{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z^{r_{t}}=\bar{y}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\geq T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\geq T</annotation></semantics></math>. Again due to the fact that <math id="A1.p10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math> is finite, we can re-fine the sub-sequence such that <math id="A1.p10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z^{r_{t}+1}=\hat{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z^{r_{t}+1}=\hat{y}</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus, without loss of generality assume that these two conditions hold, i.e. <math id="A1.p10.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z^{r_{t}}=\bar{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z^{r_{t}}=\bar{y}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.p10.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z^{r_{t}+1}=\hat{y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z^{r_{t}+1}=\hat{y}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A1.p10.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> for an appropriately refined sub-sequence. This means that</span></p>
<table id="A1.E45" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E45.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{y}\in\arg\min_{x}\|x-(x^{r_{t}}+\lambda^{-1}u^{r_{t}})\|" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><munder><mi>min</mi><mi>x</mi></munder></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{y}\in\arg\min_{x}\|x-(x^{r_{t}}+\lambda^{-1}u^{r_{t}})\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(45)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p10.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.2.1" class="ltx_text">Moreover, <math id="A1.p10.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{r_{t}+1}=u^{r_{t}}+\lambda(x^{r_{t}+1}-\hat{y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{r_{t}+1}=u^{r_{t}}+\lambda(x^{r_{t}+1}-\hat{y})</annotation></semantics></math>. Taking the <math id="A1.p10.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}</annotation></semantics></math> from both sides, we get</span></p>
<table id="A1.E46" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E46.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{y}=\bar{x}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{y}=\bar{x}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(46)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p10.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.3.1" class="ltx_text">Combining the above with Equation <a href="#A1.E45" title="Equation 45 ‣ Proof. ‣ Appendix A Proof of ‣ The Unseen Frontier: Pushing the Limits ofLLM Sparsity with Surrogate-Free ADMM" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">45</span></a> we can easily see that</span></p>
<table id="A1.E47" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E47.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\|\bar{x}-(x^{r_{t}}+\lambda^{-1}u^{r_{t}})\|\leq\|a_{i}-(x^{r_{t}}+\lambda^{-1}u^{r_{t}})\|,~i=0,\cdots,N" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mo lspace="0.0835em" rspace="0em">≤</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\bar{x}-(x^{r_{t}}+\lambda^{-1}u^{r_{t}})\|\leq\|a_{i}-(x^{r_{t}}+\lambda^{-1}u^{r_{t}})\|,~i=0,\cdots,N</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(47)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p10.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.4.1" class="ltx_text">Taking the limits <math id="A1.p10.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}</annotation></semantics></math> from both hand sides of the inequality for all the points <math id="A1.p10.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> we have</span></p>
<table id="A1.E48" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E48.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\|\bar{x}-(\bar{x}+\lambda^{-1}\bar{u})\|\leq\|a_{i}-(\bar{x}+\lambda^{-1}\bar{u})\|,~i=0,\cdots,N." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mo lspace="0.0835em" rspace="0em">≤</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\bar{x}-(\bar{x}+\lambda^{-1}\bar{u})\|\leq\|a_{i}-(\bar{x}+\lambda^{-1}\bar{u})\|,~i=0,\cdots,N.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(48)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p10.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.5.1" class="ltx_text">Thus,</span></p>
<table id="A1.E49" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E49.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\bar{x}\in\arg\min_{x\in\mathcal{S}}\|x-(\bar{x}-\lambda^{-1}\nabla f(\bar{x}))\|," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><mi>arg</mi><munder><mi>min</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{x}\in\arg\min_{x\in\mathcal{S}}\|x-(\bar{x}-\lambda^{-1}\nabla f(\bar{x}))\|,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(49)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p10.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p10.6.1" class="ltx_text">where we used the fact that <math id="A1.p10.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{u}=-\nabla f(\bar{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{u}=-\nabla f(\bar{x})</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Global hyperparameters of <span id="A1.T4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Elsa</span> shared across all models.</figcaption>
<div id="A1.T4.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:119.2pt;height:52.4pt;vertical-align:-24.4pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-23.6pt,10.4pt) scale(0.716287468870175,0.716287468870175) ;">
